  npcName: Uncle Chan
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npcIntroDialogue:
  - "Hello! I heard you did a wonderful job decorating Grandma Mali\u2019s room."
  - I work as a gardener, so I come home covered in dirt every day.
  - The problem is that my bathroom is still too empty and not very convenient to
    use.
  - "I\u2019d like to have both a shower and a bathtub, so I can choose depending
    on the time I have."
  - "I\u2019d also like the room to feel fresh, as if I were surrounded by nature."
  - Maybe a small plant or some cute decorations would make it even nicer.
  npcCompletionDialogue:
  - "This is exactly the bathroom I wanted! It\u2019s clean, convenient, and still
    feels fresh and natural. Thank you so much!"
